   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R02 BGD TRIDP Loan I - BGD-TRIDP, Loan I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats avser en bist&#xe5;ndskredit, via AB SEK som agent, p&#xe5; 32 787 263 SEK till The Governmet of the People&#xb4;s Republic of Bangladesh ifr&#xe5;n The Government of Sweden representerad av Sida. Den f&#xf6;rst l&#xe5;neutbetalningen skedde i mars 1999 och den sista utbetalningen skedde i mars 2002. Det p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r f n en &#xe5;terbetalning av l&#xe5;net och som ber&#xe4;knas vara slutamorterad 2012-12-30.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is a Development loan, by AB SEK as agent, at 32 787 263 SEK to The Government of the People&#xb4;s Republic of Bangladesh from The Government of Sweden represented by Sida. The first disbursement was made in March and the final disbursement was made in March 2002. There repayment of the loan is ongoing and the final repayment is estimated to 2012-12-30.</narrative>
  </description>
